        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Birutė Galdikas, Jane Goodall, Dian Fossey, Louis Leakey\n- Organizations/Groups: The Trimates, Leakey's Angels\n- Roles: anthropologist, primatologist, conservationist, ethologist, author\n- Topics: hominid field study\n\nFacts:\n- Birutė Marija Filomena Galdikas was born on 10 May 1946.\n- Birutė Galdikas is a Lithuanian-Canadian anthropologist, primatologist, conservationist, ethologist, and author.\n- The Trimates, sometimes called Leakey's Angels, is the name for Jane Goodall, Dian Fossey, and Birutė Galdikas.\n- Louis Leakey chose Jane Goodall, Dian Fossey, and Birutė Galdikas to study hominids in their natural environments.",
